{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國陸軍正準備在愛奧瓦州米德爾敦的愛奧瓦陸軍彈藥廠，對一批高度不穩定的疊氮化鉛進行受控引爆。這批炸藥共裝於68個桶內，總重約9700磅，因老化結晶、存在意外爆炸風險，軍方認為引爆是當前唯一可行的處置方式。引爆計劃定於當地時間周三上午9點左右進行。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587916.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:43:53.612825+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:18:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:13.741601+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:13.741601+00:00","content_hash":"aa8bb704fe74900a0f07b2cea8af074903cf26803297bf6df5220dde7598484f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}